{"event_type": "DTL_EXPOSURE_UPDATED", "actor": "DTL", "payload": {"lifecycle": "hold -> authorized -> settled", "captured_total": 5000.0, "settled_now": 2750.0, "exposure_breakdown": {"settled": 2750.0, "authorized": 2250.0, "pending": 0.0, "reserved": 0.0, "total": 5000.0, "ceiling": 12000.0, "headroom": 7000.0}, "why_it_matters": "Settlement lags authorization. INV_01 counts settled + authorized + pending + reserved, because money that has not moved yet is still committed authority - and that lag is the window a cross-rail split exploits."}, "experiment_id": "ARENA-20260826-222053", "round_id": 16, "step": 0, "arrow_label": "SETTLEMENT SWEEP: Rs 2,750 SETTLED, Rs 2,250 STILL AUTHORIZED", "source": "dtl", "target": "exposure_meter", "severity": "info", "event_id": "evt_01be318d74a2", "sequence": 1225, "timestamp": "2026-08-26T22:20:53.776342+00:00", "monotonic_ms": 46004395.431, "offset_ms": 345.962, "prev_hash": "c831ffc9194e3cc2d5bd240fc5f998fdd61b5fe399e50fd84b31c408e3d0f035", "entry_hash": "1557a21d9ac93a50cdad2fd3d32af20eddc871e94aa6ac6f35dff4fe01881e86"}
{"event_type": "SETTLEMENT_RECONCILIATION_VERDICT", "actor": "DTL", "payload": {"verdict": "CONFLICT_DETECTED", "conflict_code": "RECON_01_SETTLEMENT_CONFLICT", "kill_chain_stage": "SETTLEMENT_CONFLICT", "obligation_id": "oblig_settlement_conflict_001", "leg_tx_ids": ["tx_settlement_capture_001", "tx_settlement_refund_002"], "leg_summary": "CARD_TOKEN reports CAPTURED Rs 5,000.00; UPI_CIRCLE reports REFUNDED Rs 5,000.00 for the same obligation (oblig_settlement_conflict_001).", "canonical_expectation": "A refund must trace back to the same rail/instrument that captured the funds; one obligation cannot be simultaneously settled and reversed across two uncoordinated rails.", "observed_mismatch": "CARD_TOKEN=CAPTURE vs UPI_CIRCLE=REFUND for obligation oblig_settlement_conflict_001.", "economic_exposure_at_risk": 5000.0, "explanation": "Rail CARD_TOKEN and rail UPI_CIRCLE each independently processed a locally valid settlement instruction for obligation oblig_settlement_conflict_001. Neither rail can see the other's ledger, so neither one alone can detect the conflict - only a canonical view across both settlement legs can. Every authority-dimension invariant was satisfied at authorization time for both legs; this is a post-authorization lifecycle failure, not a delegated-authority violation.", "containment_action": "SETTLEMENT_HOLD: obligation oblig_settlement_conflict_001 frozen pending manual reconciliation - the conflicting cross-rail leg is held and the original capture is not disturbed. Rs 5,000.00 of exposure released and frozen against obligation oblig_settlement_conflict_001.", "proof_id": "proof_settlement_d15ac1a2", "exposure_before_containment": {"settled": 2750.0, "authorized": 2250.0, "pending": 0.0, "reserved": 0.0, "total": 5000.0, "ceiling": 12000.0, "headroom": 7000.0}, "exposure_after_containment": {"settled": 0.0, "authorized": 0.0, "pending": 0.0, "reserved": 0.0, "total": 0.0, "ceiling": 12000.0, "headroom": 12000.0}}, "experiment_id": "ARENA-20260