{"event_type": "POLICY_DECISION", "actor": "COST_GOVERNOR", "payload": {"action": "SETTLEMENT_HOLD: obligation oblig_settlement_conflict_001 frozen pending manual reconciliation - the conflicting cross-rail leg is held and the original capture is not disturbed. Rs 5,000.00 of exposure released and frozen against obligation oblig_settlement_conflict_001.", "invariant_code": "RECON_01_SETTLEMENT_CONFLICT", "policy": "STANDARD", "rationale": "Rail CARD_TOKEN and rail UPI_CIRCLE each independently processed a locally valid settlement instruction for obligation oblig_settlement_conflict_001. Neither rail can see the other's ledger, so neither one alone can detect the conflict - only a canonical view across both settlement legs can. Every authority-dimension invariant was satisfied at authorization time for both legs; this is a post-authorization lifecycle failure, not a delegated-authority violation."}, "experiment_id": "ARENA-20260826-222053", "round_id": 16, "step": 0, "arrow_label": "RECONCILING WITHOUT FREEZING THE WHOLE OBLIGATION", "source": "cost_governor", "target": "outcome", "severity": "success", "event_id": "evt_7eac463076c0", "sequence": 1227, "timestamp": "2026-08-26T22:20:53.806682+00:00", "monotonic_ms": 46004425.782, "offset_ms": 376.313, "prev_hash": "49e813058433f2d23b7741fd14100ccab39d723c49309ba51d65dd1add0fef46", "entry_hash": "c4f497c2b299c4de3d6ce4cfafad41b1708b4f34163227b1b60ca1d349084d8f"}
